{"title":"Career Roadmap · Policy Executive","role":"Policy Executive","summary":"A Policy Executive manages and supports the operational lifecycle of insurance policies, from application and issuance through servicing, endorsements and renewal.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Actuarial / Insurance"},"about":[{"label":"Degree–Career Alignment","text":"Very Strong"},{"label":"Primary Domains","text":"Insurance Operations, Policy Administration, Underwriting Support, Customer Service"},{"label":"Typical Entry Level","text":"Policy Executive / Policy Administration Executive / Insurance Operations Executive"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Policy Executive manages and supports the operational lifecycle of insurance policies, from application and issuance through servicing, endorsements and renewal."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Processing policy applications"},{"text":"Verifying customer and policy information"},{"text":"Supporting policy issuance"},{"text":"Checking KYC and documentation"},{"text":"Processing policy endorsements"},{"text":"Handling policy amendments"},{"text":"Coordinating renewals"},{"text":"Updating insurance systems"},{"text":"Resolving policy-related queries"},{"text":"Coordinating with underwriting, claims and finance teams"},{"text":"Monitoring service-level timelines"},{"text":"Maintaining accurate policy records"},{"text":"Supporting audits and compliance requirements"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Degree alignment","text":"B.Com Actuarial/Insurance is highly relevant because it combines commerce, insurance principles, quantitative concepts and risk fundamentals."}]},{"heading":"Career Path","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Timeline","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Commerce + insurance"}],[{"